This directory holds LoadModule fragments only.

Files with a ".conf" extension are included from httpd.conf in sorted
order. Use a two-digit prefix so load order is obvious:

  00-mpm.conf    exactly one MPM (event)
  10-base.conf   Drupal-needed Apache modules
  20-proxy.conf  proxy, then proxy_fcgi (PHP-FPM)

Do not put SetHandler, RewriteRule, or vhost config here — that belongs
in /opt/httpd/conf.d/.

Do not Include /etc/httpd/conf.modules.d/ (RPM drop-ins: systemd, dav,
libphp, every proxy backend). Module *binaries* come from
ServerRoot/modules -> /etc/httpd/modules.


